abstract: >-
  A public educational corpus of 118 A1-B2 graded stories in German, Spanish,
  French, Italian, Korean, and Russian, with sentence-aligned English
  translations, contextual vocabulary, comprehension questions,
  sentence-building exercises, teaching metadata, and source provenance.
keywords:
  - graded readers
  - language learning
